rsemble is a Rust port of MinishLab Semble (https://github.com/MinishLab/semble): the
chunking, the hybrid BM25 + static-embedding retrieval, the reciprocal-rank
fusion, the ranking boosts and penalties, the language table and the ranking
regular expressions follow Semble's design and code.

